{"data":{"body":"[P2] Honor sequence ordering when exit and late activity share a timestamp. Evidence with `task_exit` at `(atMs=60, sequence=10)` and `late_activity` at `(atMs=60, sequence=11)` passes this comparison despite recording activity after task exit. Common validation and retirement do not reject this ordering either, allowing requirement 6 to pass contradictory evidence. Use validated per-request sequence values to break timestamp ties and add a regression covering this reversed ordering.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABEyEjDg","finding_digest":"7d40d55b318429f7b4a3a1219af9348e24d2362f3b0b4d21fab9da30803a5783","finding_id":"arf_v1_pvankwzrqqu7pnfdueqzv6jury","finding_key":"lmi/evidence.py::_evidence.warm_reuse::task-exit-sequence-order","identity_key":"lmi/evidence.py::_evidence.warm_reuse::task-exit-sequence-order","line":687,"observation_digest":"9a50ceea9bacb8ff5849ed55dfd67a73495b6b6b93c4c956e0ef01c156960c1e","observation_id":"aro_v1_tjim52u3vs4p6wcj5vk57vt2on","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests/lmi/evidence.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_pvankwzrqqu7pnfdueqzv6jury","published_at":"2026-11-18T14:52:50Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lnyj73j32ihnygeurnxbtfxuo7","reviewed_base_sha":"244a58013ba0216e6e26736b6f7a86164fc9fb83","reviewed_head_sha":"8ba4f328d6e8c797dc91fc1c0ff31ce15d75d12b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":685,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":193},"record_id":"art_v1_vn2wizy23uycwwgs66akbalx33","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-18T14:52:50Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
